Package: anvil
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: openssh-client
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: filippo ferrando <ferrandodfilippo@ik.me>
Homepage: https://git.fferrando.cc/rdfilippo/anvil
Description: CLI for anvil, a Multipass-alike for cloud-init VMs and containers
 anvil manages cloud-init VMs (via direct QEMU process management) and
 Docker/Podman containers side by side, with grouped "intents", cold
 migration between anvil hosts, and a terminal UI (anvil tui).
 .
 This package installs the anvil CLI/TUI client only; the daemon that
 actually drives QEMU/Docker is the separate anvild package.
